# Oh freddled gruntbuggly, thy nacturations are to me!

enjoy poem

# As plurdled gabbleblotchits on a lurgid bee.

wait

# Groop I implore thee, my foonting turlingdromes.

wait

# And hooptiously drangle me with crinkly bindlewurdles, or I
