# Real Tea, the documented lucky path: because Traal came first,
# the interface can go into the Nutrimat now, and having Tea
# before the remaining jumps lets us choose every scenario (the
# missing sense rotates each turn once Tea powers the drive).
# Asking the Nutrimat for tea engages all of Eddie's circuits --
# which is exactly why he cannot dodge the missiles Magrathea is
# about to launch.

