# Eddie: eight turns to atomic fireball. The spare drive answers.
# The switch must be named in full now: the circuit board on the
# deck contributes a dipswitch, and a bare "press switch" earns a
# disambiguation question that eats the next command.

wait
put large plug into large receptacle
press generator switch

# Missiles -> one sperm whale and a bowl of petunias ("Oh no, not
